; qwen38-heed-layermajor-run.fk — prefill inverted: all tokens through layer 0, then layer 1.
;
; The GGUF declares 64 layers. The layer-major schedule walks every token inside
; a layer before moving to the next layer, carrying recurrent and KV state in
; position order while batching the FFN over the residual span.
;
; The witness is the body's own: run qwen38-heed-grounded-run.fk (chunk 1) and
; this one (schedule -2) on the identical prompt and compare what came out. No
; reference implementation is consulted and none is needed — two arms of the same
; body either agree or they do not, and either answer is information.
;
; Effectful: opens a sealed 29GB GGUF and drives the GPU. Do not preflight.
; preludes: form/form-stdlib/form-cli-model-generate.fk form/form-stdlib/model-registry.bml

(fcmg-heed-witness-grounded-chunk
    (mr-path (mr-find "qwen38-q8"))
    "To look a fact up in the Form body, write exactly <|form:knowledge-query|>your question<|/form:knowledge-query|> and then stop. Look up whether Sema keeps memory of you between visits, then answer in one sentence."
    48
    32
    -2)
